WEBVTT

00:08:29.129 --> 00:08:31.215
it asks for guidance and help

00:08:31.215 --> 00:08:33.759
and it receives it remotely

00:08:33.759 --> 00:08:35.135
and then it proceeds.

00:08:35.886 --> 00:08:38.514
Now, none of these really
are new concepts,

00:08:38.514 --> 00:08:40.891
as I alluded to earlier.

00:08:41.225 --> 00:08:45.062
Vision systems have been
assisting humans for a long time,

00:08:45.062 --> 00:08:48.691
especially with things
that are not visible to the naked eye.

00:08:49.441 --> 00:08:51.110
So ...

00:08:51.110 --> 00:08:52.278
microscopes, right?

00:08:52.361 --> 00:08:55.531
We’ve been studying microbes
and cells for a long time.

00:08:56.031 --> 00:08:57.032
Telescopes:

00:08:57.032 --> 00:09:02.121
we’ve been studying and detecting galaxies
millions of light-years away